+	overlay. This side only clones the shared info and the frame buffer and
+	passes requests on.
+
+	One overlay channel, for B_YCbCr422 buffers. The driver maps overlay
+	buffers into the kernel's address space with user access, so the
+	address it returns works in app_server and in the client that draws
+	into the overlay bitmap. The video shows where the frame buffer's alpha
+	is 0: app_server's key colour has alpha 0 and everything else it draws
